鉄兜団 ― [? if dnvp_candidate_1932 and dnvp_candidate_1932 != "Hugenberg":<span style="color: #3E88B3;">**[+ dnvp_candidate_1932 +]**</span>?][? if not dnvp_candidate_1932 or dnvp_candidate_1932 == "Hugenberg": <span style="color: #808080;">**[+ reactionary_candidate_1932 +]**</span> ?]

ドイツ国家商業従業員連盟（DHV）― <span style="color: #808080;">**[+ reactionary_candidate_1932 +]**</span>

全ドイツ連盟（ADV）― <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**[+ nsdap_candidate_1932 +]**</span>[? if dnvp_candidate_1932:または [? if dnvp_candidate_1932 != "Hugenberg" or dnvp_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**[+ dnvp_candidate_1932 +]**</span>?][? if dnvp_candidate_1932 == "Hugenberg" and dnvp_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #003755;">**[+ dnvp_candidate_1932 +]**</span>?]?]

